# PyInstaller
build/
dist/
*.spec
# ...except the hand-maintained full-app spec (bundles ui/icons and
# ui/assets) - a plain `pyinstaller main.py` would otherwise regenerate an
# unconfigured one and silently drop those data folders from the build.
!/klientenverwaltung.spec

